    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-86.t01",
      "en": "Here is my hook: have you ever wondered where your plastic goes?",
      "es": "Este es mi gancho: ¿te has preguntado alguna vez adónde va tu plástico?",
      "explanationEs": "Un hook abre la charla con una pregunta, una cifra o una imagen que despierta curiosidad.",
      "segments": [
        "Here is my hook: have you",
        "ever wondered where your plastic goes?"
      ],
      "audioText": "Here is my hook: have you ever wondered where your plastic goes?",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-public-speaking-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-86.t02",
      "en": "Today I will outline three ideas: the problem, the causes and one solution.",
      "es": "Hoy presentaré tres ideas: el problema, las causas y una solución.",
      "explanationEs": "I will outline + lista: la apertura anuncia la estructura de la charla.",
      "segments": [
        "Today I will outline three ideas: the",
        "problem, the causes and one solution."
      ],
      "audioText": "Today I will outline three ideas: the problem, the causes and one solution.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-public-speaking-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-86.t03",
      "en": "A clear transition helps: now let me move on to my second point, the causes.",
      "es": "Una transición clara ayuda: ahora paso a mi segundo punto, las causas.",
      "explanationEs": "Una transición dice al público dónde estamos y adónde vamos; let me move on to… es la fórmula más habitual.",
      "segments": [
        "A clear transition helps: now let me move",
        "on to my second point, the causes."
      ],
      "audioText": "A clear transition helps: now let me move on to my second point, the causes.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-public-speaking-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-86.t04",
      "en": "To recap, we have seen three causes and one solution.",
      "es": "Para recapitular, hemos visto tres causas y una solución.",
      "explanationEs": "To recap resume lo dicho antes de cerrar.",
      "segments": [
        "To recap, we have seen",
        "three causes and one solution."
      ],
      "audioText": "To recap, we have seen three causes and one solution.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-public-speaking-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-86.t05",
      "en": "My takeaway is simple: small habits change big results.",
      "es": "Mi idea final es sencilla: los pequeños hábitos cambian grandes resultados.",
      "explanationEs": "El takeaway es el mensaje que quieres que el público recuerde.",
      "segments": [
        "My takeaway is simple: small",
        "habits change big results."
      ],
      "audioText": "My takeaway is simple: small habits change big results.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
